<title>UK: SOCCER-ITALY BEAT ENGLAND 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY BEAT ENGLAND 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy beat England 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in a World Cup European group two qualifying match at</p>
<p>Wembley on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Gianfranco Zola 19</p>
<p>Attendance: 75,055</p>
</text>
